# What must never reach the build context.
#
# `data/` first and for its own reason: it is the encrypted mailbox and the stored Proton session.
# A build context is copied wholesale to the daemon and can end up in an image layer, and an image
# is a thing that gets pushed to a registry.
data/
**/data/

node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.git/
release/
apps/web/dist/
vendor/proton/sieve/dist/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
test-results/
fixtures/
*.log
*.db
*.db-*
